{"id":1050904,"chapter_id":1050904,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"审查室里，一盆插着紫藤花枝的花盆摆在以往禁闭者所坐的位置上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904002,"trial_step":2},{"step":2,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904003,"trial_step":3},{"step":3,"content":"这个画面过于离奇，但你早已接受，你认命般地给花枝浇了充足的水，之后便在座位上渐渐进入了梦乡。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904004,"trial_step":4},{"step":4,"content":"萦萦选了一个舒服的姿势，蜷缩在审查室的椅子上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1050900},{"step":5,"content":"此地依旧是紫藤花枝营造的幻境，就像她试图在幻境中搭建一个狄斯城那样，就连这个审查室，也是萦萦按照自己的兴趣，在幻境中构筑出来的。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1050900},{"step":6,"content":"现实中的你和萦萦也确实待在审查室里，只不过一个是花枝，一个陷入沉睡罢了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1050900},{"step":7,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"……到最后，还是要让你来审我啊……","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1050900},{"step":8,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"没有办法，你犯的事过于明目张胆了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1050900},{"step":9,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"众目睽睽之下进入高级别外交套房，未经申请将派遣团团首带走，最后导致对方死亡……再加上魏先生身份特殊，总之，我得给人一个说法。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1050900},{"step":10,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"哦~那个东洲小姑娘，我记得她。她老想把我带回去。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1050904},{"step":11,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"怎么办呢，小郎君，你觉得很抱歉，所以要把萦萦送给她赔罪吗？","female_content":"怎么办呢，小女娘，你觉得很抱歉，所以要把萦萦送给她赔罪吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_13","vo_trial_50904_1_13f"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1050900},{"step":12,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这是两码事，但我觉得我们之间确实需要好好谈一谈。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1050900},{"step":13,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"虽然我已经听你说过，但我还是要再问一次。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1050900},{"step":14,"content":"你短暂沉默。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1050900},{"step":15,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"为什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1050900},{"step":16,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"嗯……因为他对我许了愿。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1050904},{"step":17,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"${PlayerName}，你或许感受到了，我在第一次与他见面的时候，突然获得了大量的狂厄力量。那些全都是因为他的愿望太强烈，感染了我。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1050905},{"step":18,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"也就是说，不是他给的东洲土壤的关系？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1050900},{"step":19,"content":"她嘟嘴。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1050901},{"step":20,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"真把我当棵青菜啊？","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1050901},{"step":21,"content":"随即，眼神变得柔和。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1050900},{"step":22,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"虽然东洲乡音让我怀念，但真要恢复精神，还得靠人的心力……元气……或者灵魂。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1050900},{"step":23,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"原本普通人的愿力不足以让我醒来，但他的愿望不是突如其来，也不是心血来潮……而是这几十年来，每分每秒，每时每刻，都无法忘怀的执念。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1050900},{"step":24,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"所以，我才能动了，时间不多，我得赶紧找他。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1050900},{"step":25,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"他的想念很强，强到能够唤醒我，却也很弱，弱到撑不起老人残烛般的生命。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1050907},{"step":26,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"弥留间，他想回去看看，想找他心爱的人，兑现那个断了的承诺。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1050905},{"step":27,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"…………","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1050900},{"step":28,"options":["可那不是向你许的愿"],"style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904030,"trial_step":30,"course":3,"drawing":1050900,"choices":[{"text":"可那不是向你许的愿","goto":31}]},{"step":29,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"呵呵，看来小郎君也发现了。","female_content":"呵呵，看来小女娘也发现了。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_28","vo_trial_50904_1_28f"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1050902},{"step":30,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"老人家今年119岁，我家还能开庙会那年，他也才5岁。哪儿来的娃娃那么早熟，拉着人家姑娘就会喊一生一世一双人呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1050902},{"step":31,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"只怕还是他记错了吧……庙会并不少见，说不定人家庙上也供了哪位花神。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1050902},{"step":32,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"老人家快到双甲子了，到这年纪，财富地位早不重要，责任也终于能放下，连曾经的智慧都没了。他已经记不清他什么时候，想去哪里，又对哪位神仙许了愿。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1050902},{"step":33,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"仅仅听说一个“许愿花神活了”的消息，不管是非真假，也不管迢迢千里，就赶了过来，惦记着自己要兑现一个承诺。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1050902},{"step":34,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"他甚至忘了，爱人不是走失了，她早已离开人世。那个承诺……很久以前就兑现不了了。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1050907},{"step":35,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"可就算这样，他还是记得自己想见的人。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1050907},{"step":36,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"他把最后的生命托付给我时，一切都是模糊的，只有幽兰本人还是那么清晰。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1050907},{"step":37,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"能坚持活这么久，是不是也为再见她一面呢？虽说愿望并不能都心想事成，但支撑一个人创造一两个奇迹，还是会有的。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1050907},{"step":38,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"所以愿望实现后，他也可以安心去了。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1050907},{"step":39,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"我……很能理解他。看到他，就像看见自己。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1050906},{"step":40,"content":"她垂下眼睑，陷入沉默。庙会结束后，她常常不自觉露出这样的表情，花神卸下热闹的笑容后，眼神如此茫然寂寥，令人悲伤。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1050906},{"step":41,"content":"……这样的表情总让你却步。但……总要问出来的。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1050906},{"step":42,"options":["……你们哪里像呢？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904044,"trial_step":44,"course":3,"drawing":1050906,"choices":[{"text":"……你们哪里像呢？","goto":45}]},{"step":43,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"都怀念过去的东洲吗？都为深爱的人跨过天灾，执念百年？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1050903},{"step":44,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"还是说……对你们而言，最重要的人们已经离去，也就再没留恋……你也想跟他们一起走了吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1050903},{"step":45,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1050903},{"step":46,"content":"她看着你，像在思考你说的话。想着想着，目光变得飘渺。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1050903},{"step":47,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"对呢，我也在想，那时为什么没能跟大家一起走，为什么我还会留下……","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1050906},{"step":48,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"留在这里，人生地不熟，语言不通，水土不服，身体半天都好不了……有什么好处呢……","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1050906},{"step":49,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"明明我一直以来的的愿望已经实现了，为什么不能像魏先生那样……安心地去呢……","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1050906},{"step":50,"content":"她的声音越来越轻，话语落在你心头，却变得愈发沉重。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1050906},{"step":51,"content":"审查室安静了下来，呼吸声变得低沉迟滞，思绪狂飙搅乱你的大脑，每个细胞都在下沉，每一秒都过得无比漫长。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1050906},{"step":52,"content":"就这样不知过了多久，你艰难地开口。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1050906},{"step":53,"options":["……我希望你能幸福"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904055,"trial_step":55,"course":3,"drawing":1050906,"choices":[{"text":"……我希望你能幸福","goto":56}]},{"step":54,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"虽然这里不是你的家乡，百年后的世界也没有那么美好……但你也看到了，它其实没那么糟糕。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1050906},{"step":55,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"因为我很珍惜它，所以也想让你看看它值得人珍惜的、可爱的地方。就像你对我说的一样……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1050906},{"step":56,"content":"她在看你吗？你不知道，你的心情太过沉重，只能低下头，不去看她的脸。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1050906},{"step":57,"content":"把这些话说出口，已经耗尽你所有力气。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1050906},{"step":58,"content":"可你必须告诉她。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1050906},{"step":59,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我希望你能走出过去的痛苦，看向未来时能找到新的期盼，我希望你重新获得幸福。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1050906},{"step":60,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……我不希望这变成你的束缚，我并不想勉强你，留在一个……无法让你快乐的地方。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1050906},{"step":61,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你是自由的，萦萦。我的愿望，仅仅是希望你能幸福。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1050906},{"step":62,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"…………","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1050906},{"step":63,"content":"【空场】2秒","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1050906},{"step":64,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"……噗……哈哈哈，说你是木头，你还真是个大木头啊～","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1050902},{"step":65,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"我那会儿没走成，不就是因为有个木头把我拴住了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1050902},{"step":66,"options":["？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904068,"trial_step":68,"course":3,"drawing":1050902,"choices":[{"text":"？","goto":69}]},{"step":67,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"等等，你又在开什么玩笑？我是认真的，你知道我下了多大决心才——","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1050902},{"step":68,"content":"她不等你说完，就笑着离开了审讯椅，欺身到你面前，一时间香气袭人似乱花绽放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904070,"trial_step":70},{"step":69,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"嗯？是真不懂呢？还是装傻呢？我不说明白些，小木头就开不了窍吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904071,"trial_step":71},{"step":70,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"那我只能来凿一凿了——","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904072,"trial_step":72},{"step":71,"content":"她笑着凑近你耳边，声音却变得温柔起来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904073,"trial_step":73},{"step":72,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"对我来说，活下去真的很不容易，跟魏老先生跑老远过来一样困难。但我还是坚持了下去。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904074,"trial_step":74},{"step":73,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"曾经是为了爱我的街坊家人们，我忍过了灾难和无穷无尽的轮回，只为等一个解脱。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904075,"trial_step":75},{"step":74,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"可当解脱来时，我却没能跟上。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904076,"trial_step":76},{"step":75,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"失去了能依托的树木，告别了过去的一切，我以为自己已经一无所有了，回过头，却有一个人握住了我的手。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904077,"trial_step":77},{"step":76,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"……也许从那时起，我的心就发了新芽，有了新的愿望。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904078,"trial_step":78},{"step":77,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"这个愿望……你愿意帮我实现吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904079,"trial_step":79},{"step":78,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"我还想……一直留在你身边。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904080,"trial_step":80},{"step":79,"content":"她的眼神愈加柔软，仿若一泓清澄的潭水。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904081,"trial_step":81},{"step":80,"content":"你一时语塞，许久，才开口。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904082,"trial_step":82},{"step":81,"options":["……不会又在配合着哄我吧？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904083,"trial_step":83,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……不会又在配合着哄我吧？","goto":84}]},{"step":82,"content":"她摇头，没说出个所以然，可眼里的光彩却那样明亮，两颊绯红笑容灿烂，竟是自你们相识以来从未见过的鲜活模样。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1050902},{"step":83,"content":"像阳光突然破开阴霾，压在你心头的忧虑、愧疚、沉重的不舍和悲伤此刻被一扫而空。你看着眼前这个受尽苦难、前路不明的人，只觉得——","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1050902},{"step":84,"content":"太好了，春天终于回到她的身边。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1050902},{"step":85,"options":["……那东洲呢？还要回去吗？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1050902,"next":[88]},{"step":86,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"那是你的故乡，也是能治好你的地方。不回去吗？……你不想它吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1050902},{"step":87,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"嗯……当然想。我也想看看，紫藤枯萎后，那片土地又开出什么样的花来，人们怎么生活，现在又会许什么愿望。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1050904},{"step":88,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"魏先生说，灾难后还有人会开庙会，我也很想回去逛逛。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1050904},{"step":89,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"不过——要带着你一起去。不然，你该多不放心，多舍不得呀，怕我就这么走远了再不回来……对吧？","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1050900},{"step":90,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"那我得先请年假了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1050900},{"step":91,"content":"她笑得更开心了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1050902},{"step":92,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"就像紫藤花是必须依赖树才可以生存，过去的我依赖新年庙会的幻景，未来，我会依赖你，紧紧缠上你。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1050902},{"step":93,"options":["我知道了","先从我身上下来再说话"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904095,"trial_step":95,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我知道了","goto":96},{"text":"先从我身上下来再说话","goto":null}]},{"step":94,"content":"不知何时她已经缠上了你的脖颈。——对了，这是她变出的幻境。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904096,"trial_step":96},{"step":95,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"既然说好了不会让我回到东洲去，那我可就只能全靠小郎君你了。","female_content":"既然说好了不会让我回到东洲去，那我可就只能全靠小女娘你了。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_76","vo_trial_50904_1_76f"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904097,"trial_step":97},{"step":96,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"身体的元气可以等你锻炼好了再说，现在……至少把“心”给我吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904098,"trial_step":98},{"step":97,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"你是一个很清醒理智的人，所以你很少许愿，这样我就听不到你的心声，也得不到你的祈愿力量。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904099,"trial_step":99},{"step":98,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"但是，我想看到局长的执念，想看到你的愿望，你的自我和执着，想看得不得了。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904100,"trial_step":100},{"step":99,"options":["那我现在就许"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904101,"trial_step":101,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"那我现在就许","goto":102}]},{"step":100,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"嗯哼~？","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904102,"trial_step":102},{"step":101,"options":["希望萦萦尽快恢复健康","希望我们能一直在一起"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904103,"trial_step":103,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"希望萦萦尽快恢复健康","goto":104},{"text":"希望我们能一直在一起","goto":105}]},{"step":102,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"嘻嘻，那我们要一起努力，为了永远在一起。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904104,"trial_step":104,"next":[107]},{"step":103,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"……好呀。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904105,"trial_step":105},{"step":104,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"你的愿望，可要说话算话。","voice":["vo_trial_50904_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904106,"trial_step":106},{"step":105,"content":"几天后，以魏紫衣为代表的东洲恒云堂派遣团与萦萦再次见了一面。\n\n由于魏老先生留下的纸鹤遗书之故，魏紫衣并没有多加难为萦萦，答应让她暂时留在狄斯城。而他们会通过进口贸易手段让东洲的土壤与水源送到她的手上。","style":14,"background":2376,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904108,"trial_step":108},{"step":106,"content":"恒云堂也与狄斯城签署了一份特殊援助协议，同意完全承担由紫藤灾厄和花源庙会造成的一切修复支出和后续补偿，并以高价购得了距离紫藤残骸最近的土地。\n\n狄斯高层为有了这么一个新的冤大头而大开绿灯，恒云堂也正式进军狄斯城，跟东洲游医无患子保持密切联系。","style":14,"background":2376,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904110,"trial_step":110},{"step":107,"content":"当然，这些暂时与正在办公室呼呼大睡的MBCC局长并没有什么关系。","style":14,"background":2376,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904112,"trial_step":112},{"step":108,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"呼…………呼……","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904114,"trial_step":114},{"step":109,"content":"在他桌前，紫藤花枝抽出了新芽。有谁正透过叶尖尖注视着他。","female_content":"在她桌前，紫藤花枝抽出了新芽。有谁正透过叶尖尖注视着她。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904115,"trial_step":115},{"step":110,"content":"<i><color=#7683a2>你是个敏锐的人，小郎君。总能看透别人的笑脸，看穿人遮掩的心思。</i></color>","female_content":"<i><color=#7683a2>你是个敏锐的人，小女娘。总能看透别人的笑脸，看穿人遮掩的心思。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904117,"trial_step":117},{"step":111,"content":"<i><color=#7683a2>但你也很好糊弄，听点东洲情话就容易脸红，竟忘了对我刨根究底。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904118,"trial_step":118},{"step":112,"content":"那人没有醒，是工作太累了吧？萦萦有些心疼。她伸手，微风拂过，替她轻抚${PlayerName}的头发。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904119,"trial_step":119},{"step":113,"content":"随后，她抬头，目光穿过密不透风的围墙，看向更远处。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904120,"trial_step":120},{"step":114,"content":"<i><color=#7683a2>我感到难过，不是因为被你束缚。我想掩盖的也不是什么要求解脱的心。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904121,"trial_step":121},{"step":115,"content":"<i><color=#7683a2>城间的风声夹杂不安，阳光被缓慢扭曲……你脚下的土地深处有什么正在鼓动。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904122,"trial_step":122},{"step":116,"content":"<i><color=#7683a2>……我熟悉这种感觉。就算隔了一百年，变了模样，我也认得它。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904123,"trial_step":123},{"step":117,"content":"<i><color=#7683a2>那颗“星”近在咫尺，它——正在苏醒。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904124,"trial_step":124},{"step":118,"content":"花蔓幻象从地底抽出，轻轻覆上${PlayerName}的身体。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904125,"trial_step":125},{"step":119,"content":"<i><color=#7683a2>这以后，无论百川沸腾，山冢崒崩，亦或最后万古作尘……</i></color>","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904126,"trial_step":126},{"step":120,"content":"<i><color=#fb9259>有我陪你……</i></color>","style":14,"background":1040,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":150904128,"trial_step":128}]}